{"title":"Perry Mehrling, RIP","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/971421728/0/marginalrevolution~Perry-Mehrling-RIP.html","date":1791924676000,"content":"<p>He and I were in the same Harvard class together, and spent a good deal of time talking economics together.  We also were (briefly) bridge partners in a few games.  I was a big fan of <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Fischer-Black-Revolutionary-Idea-Finance/dp/0471457329/ref=sr_1_1?crid=2F3EDG4J3LNBA&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.lOT0IGTSiyCeUKxHIKAqAbtcZR9r-ZPNAwQvnuBl_bTGjHj071QN20LucGBJIEps.2W8JoGzFB_jv1vXJRveQXsOZsJh6zRu0q6pNdJyBKxQ&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=perry+mehrling+fischer+black&amp;qid=1791923524&amp;sprefix=perry+mehrling+fischer+black%2Caps%2C141&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">his book on Fischer Black</a>.  I am very sorry to see him <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/int_mon_econ/status/2110094844475449514\" target=\"_blank\">gone</a>.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/10/perry-mehrling-rip.html\">Perry Mehrling, RIP</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/971421728/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/971421728/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/971421728/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/971421728/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/971421728/marginalrevolution\"><i